      √ Omitting review token is blocked with 400 REVIEW_TOKEN_REQUIRED (4 ms)
      √ Super Admin pauses laboratory with valid reviewToken: sets operationalStatus=PAUSED, lab.isActive=false (9 ms)
      √ When laboratory is paused, new work assignments are blocked with 400 LAB_PAUSED (10 ms)
      √ Attempting to retire a lab with open work items is blocked with 422 UNRESOLVED_WORK_ITEMS (8 ms)
      √ Super Admin resumes laboratory with valid reviewToken: sets operationalStatus=ACTIVE, lab.isActive=true (9 ms)
      √ Concurrent lifecycle transition with stale preview token returns 409 STALE_TARGET_REVISION (30 ms)
      √ Injected audit failure rolls back lifecycle transaction atomically (10 ms)
    5. Project-to-Lab Relationships (GET/PATCH /api/projects/:id/lab-access)
      √ Project owner manager reads project lab access (6 ms)
      √ Owner Lab Manager adds Lab B as a servicing laboratory (7 ms)
      √ Non-owner manager cannot modify project servicing labs (403 Forbidden) (3 ms)

